From 5b6208f62892ec2f0b5290569fad368f4b3b42ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kartoffels123 <krtffls@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Feb 2026 15:06:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Add software occlusion culling via Intel MOC

CPU-side depth buffer culls objects behind terrain and buildings.
Terrain uses conservative min-height pooling, buildings use shrunk AABBs.
