From 026a56b8f29d88bbeb8710bb58c32df3d4dda65f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kartoffels123 <krtffls@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Feb 2026 23:26:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Add ARM/Apple Silicon support for MOC via sse2neon

Vendor sse2neon.h (MIT) to translate SSE intrinsics to ARM NEON,
enabling software occlusion culling on Apple Silicon instead of
disabling it. AVX2/AVX512 files excluded on ARM; SSE4.1 path used.
---
 extern/maskedoc/CMakeLists.txt             |    37 +-
 extern/maskedoc/CompilerSpecific.inl       |    51 +
 extern/maskedoc/MaskedOcclusionCulling.cpp |    14 +-
 extern/maskedoc/sse2neon.h                 | 11222 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 11308 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 extern/maskedoc/sse2neon.h

diff --git a/extern/maskedoc/CMakeLists.txt b/extern/maskedoc/CMakeLists.txt
